Package: statart
Title: Tidy Tools Inspired by 'Stata'
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: 
    c(
      person("Minghong", "Shen", , "mhshenaa@connect.ust.hk", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph")),
      person("dplyr authors", role = "cph",
             comment = "starwars data and documentation derived from dplyr 1.1.3; see inst/THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md")
    )
Description: Tools inspired by 'Stata' for exploring and preparing data in R.
    Provides frequency tables, summary statistics, variable inspection,
    column selection, row calculations, and binning with tidyverse-style
    interfaces and support for labelled data.
